# Masterdoc API URL

Always use production API unless the user explicitly requests a local backend:

```text
http://api.masterdoc.pro/v1
```

- Set `masterdoc.api.baseUrl=http://api.masterdoc.pro/v1` in `local.properties`.
- Code default: `DEFAULT_API_BASE_URL` in `shared/src/commonMain/kotlin/pro/masterdoc/data/config/ApiConfig.kt`.
- Do not point the app at `127.0.0.1` or `10.0.2.2` without explicit user request.
- After changing `local.properties`, rebuild the app.
